            "review_title": "Review at Food court Aeon Midori Park",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20530 contributions\n1\nSimple dinner\nMar 2026 • Business\nEvening visit for simple dinner in Aeon food court. The choice of Japanese 🇯🇵 Korean Vietnamese 🇻🇳 American 🇺🇸 or European 🇪🇺 cuisines. You pick the fishy from box, pay and take away or eat in dinning area. Cold and warm dishes for favourable price , almost no waiting. Beside you can make shopping in grocery if needed\nWritten March 24, 2026",
